{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "101192ad-8c18-5d1a-abfe-c6d8e7727c38", "source_ordinal": 26, "reading_ordinal": 4030, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "砼", "published_at": "2026-07-09T19:00:00+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/1953990821335507505/answer/2037138815870096722"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "某些是因为重大事件触发的，但这所谓的“重大”，很多时候只是个人阅历不足时的相对重大。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 42}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "比如一次考试失利、一次当众受辱（甚至可能只是略微严重的批评），在几年后看也许是小事一件，但在没有经历过的当时来看却是天崩地裂、不知所措。", "char_start": 43, "char_end": 111}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "但问题恰恰就出在这里了——最开始痛苦是有合理原因的，是觉得遇到了巨大的灾难，觉得命运不公，悲痛不已。", "char_start": 112, "char_end": 162}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "但时间久了，就会转化为另一种想法——", "char_start": 163, "char_end": 181}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "“怎么这么小的事，我都要纠结这么久？”", "char_start": 182, "char_end": 201}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "进而走向“为什么这么简单的事我都做不到？”", "char_start": 202, "char_end": 223}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "“我真无能。”", "char_start": 224, "char_end": 231}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "最开始的确是大冲击导致沮丧情绪，但这时有抑郁但却还不能算抑郁症，因为此时如果有其他较大的好消息传来，很可能当事人的心情会极大的好转。", "char_start": 232, "char_end": 298}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "真正产生深刻损害的是第二阶段，就是“开始觉得这是小事，但发现自己连小事也无法克服”的“无能认同”阶段。", "char_start": 299, "char_end": 350}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "大事做不到、大灾难受不住，这是容易原谅自己的，真正让人绝望的是担不起自己都看不起的小问题、小责任。", "char_start": 351, "char_end": 400}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "不得不承认“一根稻草就压得自己喘不过气来”，不得不接受自己是“真无能”，才是抑郁转化为长期严重问题的关键节点。", "char_start": 401, "char_end": 456}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "但在这里当事人犯了一个错误——你忘了在这个时候你还背着巨大的精神包袱，这时候你真正背负的不是一根稻草而已，而是一块巨石再加一根稻草。", "char_start": 457, "char_end": 523}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "这个时候如果你不算巨石，只算稻草，就会不断的得出“我连一根稻草也经不起”的结论，而这又会把你背上的巨石加重一两。", "char_start": 524, "char_end": 580}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "于是你眼看着稻草没变，却发现自己比之前更背不起这根稻草了。", "char_start": 581, "char_end": 610}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "于是你还要更焦虑、更恐慌。你的恐慌又要在巨石上加一两。", "char_start": 611, "char_end": 638}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "这块石头几乎就是你一两一两自己浇筑出来的。", "char_start": 639, "char_end": 660}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "敲开看看，除了包在最里面那块是真石头，大半都是混凝土。", "char_start": 661, "char_end": 688}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "还是真·古法手作的。", "char_start": 689, "char_end": 699}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "这听上去是不是简直像一个玩笑？但是很遗憾，哪怕就是这样明白告诉你了，甚至你自己也惨笑过了，从头再来一遍，你也不容易摆脱这种愚蠢。", "char_start": 700, "char_end": 764}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "因为这种强迫性的冲动是写在我们的基因本能里的。", "char_start": 765, "char_end": 788}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "认识自身的时候永远别忘了，我们在下意识层面基本上还只是一群猴子。", "char_start": 789, "char_end": 821}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "我们为什么会如此焦虑？归根结底是对自己在猴群里的排位有焦虑。在我们的本能里，短短几年后就要进入交配期，就要在猴群中产生几乎要持续一生的尊卑秩序。", "char_start": 822, "char_end": 894}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "所以我在这时受到了重大挫折，尤其是相对其他同龄猴子受到了明显特殊的损伤，对我就会有巨大的刺激。这种刺激要么推动我积极的自救，促使我短期内就补平优势，恢复平等的竞争资格；要么我短期补平优势失败，本能就要通过焦虑的持续恶化直接把我推入消极、失能的状态，导致我几乎失去竞争能力。这样我这已经受损的个体就等于直接退赛了。于是我就不会再在猴王竞争中对仍然完好的个体造成太多不必要的损害。", "char_start": 895, "char_end": 1083}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "如果只有六只健壮的年轻猴去彼此搏斗争王，比起十只猴去争，搏斗的烈度显然是前者更小，这样新猴王也罢、争王失败者也罢，都会因为我被自然机制强制退赛而少受很多伤，甚至连被退赛的我自己，面对的风险都变小了。", "char_start": 1084, "char_end": 1183}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "所以这份由严重挫折引发的“大家一定会瞧不起我”“我没有前途了”的社会性焦虑在客观上保护了猴群。", "char_start": 1184, "char_end": 1231}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "它只是对遭遇不幸和挫折的个体有伤害。", "char_start": 1232, "char_end": 1250}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "事实上，抑郁情绪在高社会性动物中普遍存在，而且社会性越强、首领地位越明显、争夺越激烈，抑郁的易感性就越大。", "char_start": 1251, "char_end": 1304}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "类似大象、犬、鲸这样的高社会性种族，必然因为社会性的发展带来抑郁的易感性。我们人类作为社会性之王，这份诅咒自然也就最深最重。", "char_start": 1305, "char_end": 1367}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "然而——注意这个然而——我们人类在近一万年，尤其是近5000年内有一个巨大的跨越——我们的社群规模由猿猴时期的数十个体、扩大到了数千、上万甚至十万、百万级别。而且我们的社会地位、社群角色也极大的复杂化了。", "char_start": 1368, "char_end": 1470}, {"paragraph_id": "P030", "field": "body", "index": 30, "text": "我们早已不是短短几年就要性成熟然后争主从、定终身的小族群居野兽，而是需要超过十几年甚至二三十年发育期、启蒙期，最后以复杂的角色融入到社会合作而不是社会竞争中的超高社会性生物。", "char_start": 1471, "char_end": 1558}, {"paragraph_id": "P031", "field": "body", "index": 31, "text": "我们的竞争也不再是“拼死肉搏”这种高风险的形式。", "char_start": 1559, "char_end": 1583}, {"paragraph_id": "P032", "field": "body", "index": 32, "text": "问题是这5000年的文化心理发展很难在幼年时期覆盖演化了上百万年的兽性本能，在我们的幼年阶段，我们的默认程序还是把自己当作几年后就要在这几十个同龄人群体里分尊卑的猴子。", "char_start": 1584, "char_end": 1668}, {"paragraph_id": "P033", "field": "body", "index": 33, "text": "因此一点点风吹草动都会让我们介意万分，背上重大的精神负担，而且一旦短期没有缓解、就会容易通过上述强迫性的自我精神戕害进入“自动退赛”通道。", "char_start": 1669, "char_end": 1738}, {"paragraph_id": "P034", "field": "body", "index": 34, "text": "可悲的是——那个自然不惜触发你的自毁程序来保全的猴王赛早在五千年前就停办了。", "char_start": 1739, "char_end": 1777}, {"paragraph_id": "P035", "field": "body", "index": 35, "text": "它在为一场早就停办的比赛，推动受伤的你进入退赛程序。", "char_start": 1778, "char_end": 1804}, {"paragraph_id": "P036", "field": "body", "index": 36, "text": "其实你介意万分的“同学们的鄙视”，根本不会决定你的命运。你现在在这个班上，乃至这个学校里的排名，也根本决定不了你的命运。你基本确定不会在这个小群体里度过一生。", "char_start": 1805, "char_end": 1884}, {"paragraph_id": "P037", "field": "body", "index": 37, "text": "与此相绑定的一切的社会性焦虑，你都在错误的高估。", "char_start": 1885, "char_end": 1909}, {"paragraph_id": "P038", "field": "body", "index": 38, "text": "它本不该在这个时代还对你有上个时代所必要的那种强烈影响。但是很遗憾，这类新平衡的达成，靠的是“焦虑程度过强的个体因为过度抑郁而丧失生育机会、渐渐从种族基因池中退出”的形式实现的。而因为人类生产力的飞速发展，这个过程因为生存条件的大幅宽松化而进行得非常缓慢。", "char_start": 1910, "char_end": 2038}, {"paragraph_id": "P039", "field": "body", "index": 39, "text": "于是我们人类被卡在这样一种诡异的发展机制上：在成年之前，我们无意识的从猴子的视角看待自己的社会前途，极易发生错误的适应——即本能的用只在几十只猴子组成的小群落里才会存在的危机恐吓自己，导致一直饱受本质上错位的精神折磨。然而却又因为物质条件优厚，很难被这折磨淘汰，而把这种易受折磨的本能一代代的成功传承了下来。", "char_start": 2039, "char_end": 2193}, {"paragraph_id": "P040", "field": "body", "index": 40, "text": "这使得青春期的精神问题成了一个人类文化的痼疾——即使成年人清清楚楚的知道小孩子们是在对几乎没有实质影响的小事过度反应，也无法简单的通过劝说、强制避免幼崽一头扎进这种错误并饱受折磨。", "char_start": 2194, "char_end": 2284}, {"paragraph_id": "P041", "field": "body", "index": 41, "text": "你能做的，就是在理解这些前因后果之后，学会坚定的抗拒内心的过度反应。", "char_start": 2286, "char_end": 2320}, {"paragraph_id": "P042", "field": "body", "index": 42, "text": "“我会觉得这事很严重，但是我是错的。我知道这是错的，但我还是会因为几百万年的习性而这样想。所以我这样想并不是一种愚蠢或者无能，只是一种不能不还的‘进化债’、是猴子变成人的后遗症和应有代价”。", "char_start": 2321, "char_end": 2416}, {"paragraph_id": "P043", "field": "body", "index": 43, "text": "这就像一个醉酒的人能正确认识到自己是醉了，即使什么别的措施都不做，也会仅仅因为这个准确的认识而消除很多不必要的恐慌——否则走不了直线、说不清话、看东西重影这些症状本身就极为恐怖，由此产生的恐惧心理对人的损害远比酒精本身严重。", "char_start": 2417, "char_end": 2529}, {"paragraph_id": "P044", "field": "body", "index": 44, "text": "记住，“一根稻草也拿不动”在你受本能驱使不停往背包里灌水泥的前提下是正常的。", "char_start": 2531, "char_end": 2569}, {"paragraph_id": "P045", "field": "body", "index": 45, "text": "有病的不是你个人，而是我们这个种族。", "char_start": 2570, "char_end": 2588}, {"paragraph_id": "P046", "field": "body", "index": 46, "text": "认清这个必然的过程，在这过程中保持耐心，等待“进化债”自然过期。", "char_start": 2589, "char_end": 2621}, {"paragraph_id": "P047", "field": "body", "index": 47, "text": "停止往你的背包里塞土。", "char_start": 2622, "char_end": 2633}, {"paragraph_id": "P048", "field": "body", "index": 48, "text": "不要担心，会好的。", "char_start": 2634, "char_end": 2643}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 50}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0574"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：绝大多数抑郁症患者一定是由某个重大不幸事件引起吗？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029", "P030", "P031", "P032", "P033", "P034", "P035", "P036", "P037", "P038", "P039", "P040", "P041", "P042", "P043", "P044", "P045", "P046", "P047", "P048"], "summary": "围绕“砼”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“某些是因为重大事件触发的，但这所谓的“重大”，很多时候只是个人阅历不足时的相对重大。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "某些是因为重大事件触发的，但这所谓的“重大”，很多时候只是个人阅历不足时的相对重大。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 42, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "6587f538-6d67-5561-99dd-2eaf61719621", "source_ordinal": 27, "reading_ordinal": 4031, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "眠种", "published_at": "2026-07-09T19:00:00+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/427364036/answer/2038687768700772586"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "有没有听说过斯瓦尔巴全球种子库？", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 16}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "这里保存着全球所有农作物的种子。干什么用？为了防止哪天全球浩劫，导致某些物种灭绝。那时候可以从原始种中恢复人类农业的生机。", "char_start": 17, "char_end": 78}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "又比如我们现在吃的香蕉，实际上是从野生种中经过层层优选培育而来。但现在都知道这类培育种因为基因完全一致，一旦有针对它们的特种病毒、虫害出现，它们就很容易出现灭绝性危机。那样我们就又要从原始品种重走一遍选育之路，重建新的香蕉谱系。", "char_start": 79, "char_end": 193}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "人类的手工能力就非常类似这种野生种、原始种。", "char_start": 194, "char_end": 216}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "人类的纯手工能力是即使人类失去整个现代工业基础，只要地球生态圈存在，我们也可以仅凭双手恢复的基础技术水平。", "char_start": 217, "char_end": 270}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "没有了现代工业，我们可以从手工里重新采矿、古法冶炼，手工锻打，一层一层搓出机床、电机、进而电气电路、计算机、光纤网络、人工智能来。", "char_start": 271, "char_end": 336}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "说得不好听点，万一哪天世界大战、遍地原子弹、中子弹、脉冲弹、石墨炸弹摧毁了我们的关键基础能源设施、信息中枢，我们的整个信息化、自动化的文明就要严重的依赖手工切割、钻孔、焊接、打磨去从头重建。", "char_start": 337, "char_end": 432}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "那时候我们的手艺活的极限就是我们重建速度的极限了。", "char_start": 433, "char_end": 458}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "是我们整个技术文明的原始胚芽。", "char_start": 459, "char_end": 474}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "环境的极端畸变是可以突然消灭一个物种的。但是很悲剧的一点是，这样的畸变很可能过个十来年又恢复回来，假设有某种神奇的力量能把那个灭绝的物种庇护这么十来年，那么等待气候恢复后这个物种完全可以延续下去。", "char_start": 476, "char_end": 574}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "而生态圈这个东西，在总体上有物种越丰富，越有韧性和弹性，从而越能保持自稳定性的特性。", "char_start": 575, "char_end": 617}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "所以我们要保护人类的手工能力，这甚至在文明越是发展时显得越是重要。", "char_start": 618, "char_end": 651}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "所谓“市场淘汰”是没有问题的，也没有人拦得住。", "char_start": 652, "char_end": 675}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "遗产保护只不过是将一度在市场上获得过成功的整套技术方案通过少量津贴做最低限度的保存，这并不是要“帮助过时技术抵抗新技术的竞争”的意思，谈不到阻碍新生事物发展，仅仅只是保留老王者的物种生存罢了。", "char_start": 676, "char_end": 772}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "某种意义上这也是对人类自身的一种终极抚慰——尽力去创造你的辉煌，构建你的遗产，一旦你有了自己的字号，你的遗产就可以永生不死，人类会把它保存好，不受所谓技术进步、文明发展的威胁。", "char_start": 773, "char_end": 861}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "它不会因为“落后”“过时”而化为乌有，而是会永远的存在，一旦出现属于它的春天，它可以再次发芽生长。", "char_start": 862, "char_end": 911}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "不但如此，它的故事会永远被人铭记，它自身也会成为后代精神创造和探索的启发。", "char_start": 912, "char_end": 949}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "这对现在活着、将来会死去的人们是一个巨大的心灵安慰，你没发现吗？就像人类的文明是从葬礼和祭奠开始的一样——", "char_start": 950, "char_end": 1003}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "人类最大的恐惧并不是死亡，而是“绝祀”。", "char_start": 1004, "char_end": 1024}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "无人传承、无人纪念，宛如不曾存在。", "char_start": 1025, "char_end": 1042}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "我们保存ta们，翌日才有我们自身被保存，此时我们才得到存在或有意义、可有意义的安慰。", "char_start": 1043, "char_end": 1085}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "这不是人类对过去的无谓眷恋，甚至也不仅仅是技术的必要，而是我们对自身的珍惜和追求。", "char_start": 1086, "char_end": 1127}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "伟业不死，只是逢冬而眠。", "char_start": 1128, "char_end": 1140}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "所以只管去追求你的伟业，不要担心将来我们会忘记。", "char_start": 1141, "char_end": 1165}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "你看那些我们都记得好好的呢，不是吗？", "char_start": 1166, "char_end": 1184}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 26}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0574"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：为什么都在说要保护传统手艺，难道不应该让这些落后的东西去直面时代的淘汰？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025"], "summary": "围绕“眠种”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“有没有听说过斯瓦尔巴全球种子库？”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "有没有听说过斯瓦尔巴全球种子库？", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 16, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "b4af6921-69d1-5962-ab5f-f7f86f20a794", "source_ordinal": 28, "reading_ordinal": 4032, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "守在门外的人", "published_at": "2026-07-09T19:00:00+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/443301560/answer/2038363981069465039"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "就正常的教育引导她啊，正常的谈论生理知识、性健康常识、性文化现象。如何避孕、如何防范性传播疾病、如何保护性隐私和性权利……", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 61}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "严肃、关切、清晰，数据翔实。", "char_start": 62, "char_end": 76}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "但不建议直接去触及色情片本身，也不建议轻易直接和她谈论她看这些片子的行为，更不太建议一些自居大胆开明的家长和孩子大谈色情片经验之类。", "char_start": 77, "char_end": 143}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "因为性有一个很特殊的属性——私密的性和公开的性是两种不同的事物。", "char_start": 144, "char_end": 176}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "两个人在私室的性体验，和两个人在公开场合展示性行为，甚至仅仅是意识到自己的性体验正在被观看，都会触发当事人强烈的注意力转换。", "char_start": 177, "char_end": 239}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "这东西是深藏在人类的演化本能里的——动物发情交配是一定要寻找安全的环境的，而且一旦意识到有未知第三方的存在，往往都会触发严重的警觉和焦虑。毕竟这时候如果被袭击，自己会处在非常被动而危险的境地。", "char_start": 240, "char_end": 336}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "所以“周围无人”的控制感、安全感是一个很强的心理依靠，非常不建议父母去主动打破它。", "char_start": 337, "char_end": 378}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "在性的问题上，父母要坚定的克制住自己直接窥探、插手子女性实践的冲动，不要去做那个惊扰子女的草丛里的可怕响动、那个被担心在暗中存在的眼睛。", "char_start": 380, "char_end": 448}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "这种侵入性的存在感要么会严重困扰子女，要么又会反过来刺激子女强行尝试脱敏。前者会严重的破坏子女的性体验，而后者又会给子女带来很多你不想看到的冒险性和叛逆性。", "char_start": 449, "char_end": 527}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "好好的爱ta们，平铺直叙的教给ta们必要的知识，然后相信ta们会善用这些知识保护好自己。", "char_start": 528, "char_end": 572}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "不要搞“因材施教”“对症下药”，不要让子女担心你在“明察秋毫”。", "char_start": 573, "char_end": 605}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "你希望子女慎重对待性关系，那么你这个主动忍受自己的焦虑而小心的保护着ta的性隐私、性自主权的爱的姿态，是最好推动子女严肃对待自己的人生重大选择的正面因素。", "char_start": 606, "char_end": 683}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "ta知道你爱ta，而ta也爱你，ta舍不得你太担心、不愿你受伤、难过，希望你健康、开心，ta自己会发动一切智慧去做最好的努力。", "char_start": 684, "char_end": 747}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "你所要担心的反而不是ta胡作非为、犯各种胆大妄为的错误，反而是要担心子女关心、顾忌你过甚，而被你自己的思想局限所禁锢，被迫放弃一些对ta其实更好的选择，限制了ta的幸福可能。", "char_start": 748, "char_end": 835}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "所以，你在谈论性的种种安全常识时，要谨慎的保持中立和谦卑，不要仅仅因为自己的好恶而对这个那个做轻佻的褒贬——既不要随便骂，也不要随便夸。", "char_start": 836, "char_end": 904}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "可以说“这个我本人不太赞同 / 不太能接受 / 比较欣赏 / 比较认同”，不要说“这简直猪狗不如 / 不堪入目 / 丢脸至极”。", "char_start": 905, "char_end": 969}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "一代人有一代人的态度，这是ta们的自由，一旦你不尊重这种自由，想要自己悄悄的堵路修墙，你就会成为事实的敌人，甚至比一般的敌人更坏更可恶，因为一般的敌人好歹没有口口声声自称真爱。", "char_start": 970, "char_end": 1058}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "而一旦你成了这种虚伪险恶的敌人，你最厌恶的反而要对孩子形成最大的诱惑，你所恐惧的反而对ta是最大的向往，你反而在催生你最想避免的结果。", "char_start": 1059, "char_end": 1126}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "你真正要顾虑的，是子女在家里对正直、真诚、谦卑的爱体验太少，对获得亲密关系过于焦虑，于是在孤独恐惧的驱使下赤手空拳的冒险走入陷阱。", "char_start": 1127, "char_end": 1192}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "其实我是担心你的，我很担心。其实用不着无意中撞见的“可疑行为”，我就在担心。", "char_start": 1193, "char_end": 1231}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "其实有没有撞见有什么区别呢？没有撞见，我就可以安心的相信你没有接触到这些东西，相信你对这些诱惑力十足的东西肯定免疫吗？", "char_start": 1232, "char_end": 1291}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "所以不必撞见，我已经在担心了。", "char_start": 1292, "char_end": 1307}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "上天知道，我经常在脑海里播放最可怕的画面，肝胆俱碎。有时看到可怕的社会新闻，我真的有点承受不住。", "char_start": 1308, "char_end": 1356}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "但是我不能只顾我自己的担心，不顾对你的刺激和损伤。", "char_start": 1357, "char_end": 1382}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "我知道我有父母的特权，即使横加干涉、踹开房门也不会受到社会的指责，但我不能总是这样任由我的焦虑抢过方向盘，不断的剥夺你对自己生活的预期和安排。", "char_start": 1383, "char_end": 1454}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "我要做我自己的敌人，守在你的门前，把我自己挡在门外。", "char_start": 1455, "char_end": 1481}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "我要盲目的相信你会心疼我守卫在门口，和我自己搏斗至心中流血的痛苦，认真的对待那些知识，保护我不惜生命保护的你自己。", "char_start": 1482, "char_end": 1539}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "我这也不只是相信你、寄望于你，而是我也相信这个世界的一切自然规律和历史进程最终都是围绕让真正的爱得到祝福的逻辑而设计的。我相信世界会看在我的坚决和刻苦的份上，给我——也是给你——必要的好运。", "char_start": 1540, "char_end": 1635}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "这事很讽刺，我若任由我的焦虑成为你的负担，你便自然不会再看顾我的痛苦，因为我的痛苦本就是伤你的利刃。", "char_start": 1636, "char_end": 1686}, {"paragraph_id": "P030", "field": "body", "index": 30, "text": "而我咬住牙关守住我的焦虑，只把我浑浊的心流里滤出、熬出的清水给你，我的痛苦和恐惧才会自然得到你的照顾。", "char_start": 1687, "char_end": 1738}, {"paragraph_id": "P031", "field": "body", "index": 31, "text": "因为我爱你，所以我的痛苦才成其为你的顾念，我才可以因为你的顾念，少受痛苦。", "char_start": 1739, "char_end": 1776}, {"paragraph_id": "P032", "field": "body", "index": 32, "text": "所以我从不担心你“不懂事”，我只担心自己有没有怠慢该有的思考和努力，有没有丧失为你再向前冲锋的勇气。", "char_start": 1777, "char_end": 1827}, {"paragraph_id": "P033", "field": "body", "index": 33, "text": "想明白了，意识到了这样做才是爱，我总是会有勇气的。", "char_start": 1828, "char_end": 1853}, {"paragraph_id": "P034", "field": "body", "index": 34, "text": "你别担心我。", "char_start": 1854, "char_end": 1860}, {"paragraph_id": "P035", "field": "body", "index": 35, "text": "我也不担心你。", "char_start": 1861, "char_end": 1868}, {"paragraph_id": "P036", "field": "body", "index": 36, "text": "你也别担心你自己。", "char_start": 1869, "char_end": 1878}, {"paragraph_id": "P037", "field": "body", "index": 37, "text": "你是在爱里长大的孩子，你会很好的。", "char_start": 1879, "char_end": 1896}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 38}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0574"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：我的女儿才13岁，前两天发现她偷着看黄色小电影，我都快崩溃了，我该怎么去教育引导她？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029", "P030", "P031", "P032", "P033", "P034", "P035", "P036", "P037"], "summary": "围绕“守在门外的人”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“就正常的教育引导她啊，正常的谈论生理知识、性健康常识、性文化现象。如何避孕、如何防范性传播疾病、如何保护性隐私和性权利……”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "就正常的教育引导她啊，正常的谈论生理知识、性健康常识、性文化现象。如何避孕、如何防范性传播疾病、如何保护性隐私和性权利……", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 61, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "e0255cb2-a6bc-538a-8962-0fd9977369d3", "source_ordinal": 25, "reading_ordinal": 4033, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "十里一碑", "published_at": "2026-07-10T07:00:00+08:00", "platform": "afdian", "url": "https://www.ifdian.net/p/2e599e7e763811f18a8c5254001e7c00"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "quote", "index": 1, "text": "完成一件事情后, 即使是在别人看来是遥不可及非常了不起的成就, 或者自己原本完全没料到能成功的事情, 事后也会从心里认为\"这不过是我该做的而已\". 而对自己的错误失败则完全不能原谅, 会在心里自责很久. 而且即使感到一时快乐, 也会很快被无处不在的担忧顾虑所代替. 长此以往, 情绪长期压抑. 请问该如何解决?", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 155}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "你有没有想过——你在“为该高兴的事情高兴”上对自己要求不高？", "char_start": 156, "char_end": 186}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "你明知道这样是好的，明知道这是对的，更有利于你负重行远，你自己都说为此苦恼，你这时候怎么就对自我要求不高了？", "char_start": 187, "char_end": 241}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "因为做到了卓越的成就、克服了巨大的困难而又能云淡风轻，会显得自己胸怀广大，志存高远，自我要求的标准不同吗？", "char_start": 242, "char_end": 295}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "凡夫俗子才会大惊小怪，而且为这么小的成就欣喜异常，怎么能不小富即安，还怎么做大事，是吗？", "char_start": 296, "char_end": 340}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "我将来是要横扫千军的，只是打败了街上的王二狗，哪怕他个头比我壮，也不值得高兴，一高兴我就只能止步于打败王二狗了，就没动力继续努力，横扫千军了，是吗？", "char_start": 341, "char_end": 415}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "按这个设计，你一辈子就只能高兴一次，就是统治世界的那一次，在这之前你怎么着都只能按量酌减。", "char_start": 416, "char_end": 461}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "要是运气不好，最后没能统治世界，那这辈子都不能开怀大笑了。", "char_start": 462, "char_end": 491}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "你自己惨倒也罢了，你身边的人都得配合你的高远志向，无法庆祝任何“微不足道的成就”，不光不能庆贺你的成就，而且只要有你在场，别人庆祝自己的成就都不痛快，因为你神色淡然，光是往那儿一坐，就等于无声的“这有什么可高兴的”。你知道不妥，勉强装出笑容来恭喜人，何止没有改善，还会再捅一刀——“算了，我迁就你们一下，装一下吧”。", "char_start": 492, "char_end": 650}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "简直快乐消音器。", "char_start": 651, "char_end": 659}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "这么多恶果，接近没收了你一切的快乐，自然法的态度其实已经很明显了——ta不喜欢人这么做。", "char_start": 660, "char_end": 704}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "因为你这样等于自诩超人，把自己拔高到神的地位上去了。", "char_start": 705, "char_end": 731}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "这种自我体认是很令人迷醉，但必造成你脱离一切原本为人准备好的扶助机制，不但要自陷孤独，还要被人类排斥——人是无法忍受有人自居为神的。", "char_start": 732, "char_end": 798}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "你自认为是超人，那好，那你显然就不需要任何帮助了，你做到什么也不值得我们钦佩了，你要做不到什么我们能做到的事，那就加倍羞耻了。", "char_start": 799, "char_end": 862}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "所有人都等着看你失败和陨落，等你再次证实神不可能是你这个水平。", "char_start": 863, "char_end": 894}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "你可以志存高远，可以对自己有高要求，但不允许把达成这种高要求看成理所当然、犹如探囊取物，而要把达成这些成就正确的理解为需要巨大的运气。", "char_start": 895, "char_end": 962}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "你可能是看了谢安那什么“小儿辈破贼矣”的轶事，所以心有向往。", "char_start": 963, "char_end": 993}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "问题是，他那个做派是因为他出身顶级世家豪门，起步就在半空中，一入仕就位极人臣。那些需要巨大的运气才能克服的困难，是被他几代的祖先、多位兄弟叔伯合力克服过了，他是站在整个家族成就的肩膀上，起点被抬高了，这并不代表从头到尾的整个奋斗过程就会那么轻而易举。", "char_start": 994, "char_end": 1119}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "做事情，立意要高，着眼要低。", "char_start": 1120, "char_end": 1134}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "啥意思？", "char_start": 1135, "char_end": 1139}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "立意要名留青史，可以，但着眼宜放在“成为足以名留青史的某项事业的一个有效参与者”。", "char_start": 1140, "char_end": 1181}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "我要有运气能成就这样的功绩，那固然好；没这个运气，能为这样的事业打个基础，我也满意了。", "char_start": 1182, "char_end": 1225}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "而且我先盯在打基础上，基础打了一根桩我都能欣喜若狂起来。", "char_start": 1226, "char_end": 1254}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "这么漫长到近乎没有尽头的道路，我需要一切我能够的着的欣喜若狂。", "char_start": 1255, "char_end": 1286}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "有时候甚至需要想法子手搓一点，借一点，甚至不知廉耻的偷一点。", "char_start": 1287, "char_end": 1317}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "能成为大数学家的，往往并不是那些解开了复杂问题却面不改色的人，而是那些解开了很普通的谜题就能手舞足蹈、蹦蹦跳跳的人。", "char_start": 1318, "char_end": 1376}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "后者反而更有天赋，前者往往卡在哪里就陷入“连这也搞不定”的情绪风暴之中，再也爬不起来了。", "char_start": 1377, "char_end": 1421}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "说到底，其实是前者对自己的志向不够尊敬，你没发现吗？", "char_start": 1422, "char_end": 1448}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "行百里者半九十，说的是到了九十也要认识到离一百还有距离，不能假定剩下的十里一定顺顺利利，可没说到了九十不可庆祝，不可纪念，不值得肯定。", "char_start": 1449, "char_end": 1516}, {"paragraph_id": "P030", "field": "body", "index": 30, "text": "我先把九十里的界碑插上，就算我倒在了一百里之前，别人也能从九十里出发了，我为何不自豪？", "char_start": 1517, "char_end": 1560}, {"paragraph_id": "P031", "field": "body", "index": 31, "text": "何止九十有碑，十里一碑，碑碑有祭。", "char_start": 1561, "char_end": 1578}, {"paragraph_id": "P032", "field": "body", "index": 32, "text": "“我乃鲁钝懒惰之人，全靠天意提携，乃至于此。不是我多勤奋、智慧、勇敢，实在是过于受到天意恩宠，不敢辜负，所以奋勇向前”——这样的心思，才能如永动机一样无视一切挫折困苦，始终温和而有力的托住你向前。", "char_start": 1579, "char_end": 1677}, {"paragraph_id": "P033", "field": "body", "index": 33, "text": "丢掉那种“贵族气”，好好的尊敬你的志向，重新承认与它的荣耀相称的遥远和艰难，你自然能坦然的对你的每一点成就兴奋，你也才会不断从这些成就中获得源源的动力。", "char_start": 1678, "char_end": 1754}, {"paragraph_id": "P034", "field": "body", "index": 34, "text": "谦卑是一种绝对正确的智慧，永远选择谦卑，并为自己的勇气自豪。", "char_start": 1755, "char_end": 1785}, {"paragraph_id": "P035", "field": "body", "index": 35, "text": "永远不要背弃谦卑，去贪图一时的虚荣。", "char_start": 1786, "char_end": 1804}, {"paragraph_id": "P036", "field": "body", "index": 36, "text": "时时刻刻记得提醒自己——“我是不是又傲慢了，又把这些看得太理所当然”，养成习惯，你不但会更多的为自己高兴，也会更由衷的为朋友们高兴。", "char_start": 1805, "char_end": 1871}, {"paragraph_id": "P037", "field": "body", "index": 37, "text": "和人民在一起，整个世界都会亮起来。", "char_start": 1872, "char_end": 1889}, {"paragraph_id": "P038", "field": "body", "index": 38, "text": "你的快乐会长上翅膀飞回来的。", "char_start": 1890, "char_end": 1904}, {"paragraph_id": "P039", "field": "body", "index": 39, "text": "事实上，你现在都可以庆祝一下了——因为你能在现在就明白这个道理，对你之后的一生是巨大的福利。", "char_start": 1905, "char_end": 1951}, {"paragraph_id": "P040", "field": "body", "index": 40, "text": "我当年就不明白这个道理，你已经比我幸运了。", "char_start": 1952, "char_end": 1973}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"quote": 1, "paragraph": 39}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0574"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：如何解决因对自我要求太高而导致过高的\"快乐阈值\"?；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029", "P030", "P031", "P032", "P033", "P034", "P035", "P036", "P037", "P038", "P039", "P040"], "summary": "围绕“十里一碑”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“完成一件事情后, 即使是在别人看来是遥不可及非常了不起的成就, 或者自己原本完全没料到能成功的事情, 事后也会从心里认为\"这不过是我该做的而已\". 而对自己的错误失败则完全不能原谅, 会在心里自责很久. 而且即使感到一时快乐, 也会很快被无处不在的担忧顾虑所代替. 长此以往, 情绪长期压抑. 请问该如何解决?”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "quote", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "完成一件事情后, 即使是在别人看来是遥不可及非常了不起的成就, 或者自己原本完全没料到能成功的事情, 事后也会从心里认为\"这不过是我该做的而已\". 而对自己的错误失败则完全不能原谅, 会在心里自责很久. 而且即使感到一时快乐, 也会很快被无处不在的担忧顾虑所代替. 长此以往, 情绪长期压抑. 请问该如何解决?", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 155, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "4323b869-06ea-5335-a116-9418e052e7a4", "source_ordinal": 24, "reading_ordinal": 4034, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "靶向药", "published_at": "2026-07-11T07:00:00+08:00", "platform": "afdian", "url": "https://www.ifdian.net/p/f118cbba771411f19cc65254001e7c00"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "quote", "index": 1, "text": "当我的利益被侵犯或受损的时候，我却羞于为自己争取利益。也不知道为什么，总是没有勇气说出自己的要求，担心大家因为“我为自己争取利益”而不喜欢我。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 71}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "侵犯你利益的人，有没有侵犯别人的利益？", "char_start": 72, "char_end": 91}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "如果从头到尾只有你一个人的利益被侵犯，而这个人非常聪明，懂得把从你这里掠夺的利益和别人瓜分，那么你的问题就不是如何争取利益，而是要赶紧走人，因为在这种情况下，你根本就不是这个组织的成员，而只是ta们的资源。", "char_start": 92, "char_end": 195}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "如果这人侵犯你的利益只是肥了ta自己，于别人无益，那么你去争取自己的利益自然也就不存在“别人不喜欢你”了。", "char_start": 196, "char_end": 249}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "那只是你和那个人之间的事。", "char_start": 250, "char_end": 263}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "但这并不是你直接与之对峙的最佳时机。", "char_start": 264, "char_end": 282}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "最佳时机是这人既然侵占成性而且一向吃独食，迟早会侵占其他人的利益。", "char_start": 283, "char_end": 316}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "这个时候，你可以出头为别人争取利益。", "char_start": 317, "char_end": 335}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "“当初ta搞我，我还以为是一时误会，现在连你小张、老刘都搞，我实在看不下去了。”", "char_start": 336, "char_end": 376}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "你总不担心小张，老刘不喜欢你了吧？", "char_start": 377, "char_end": 394}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "还是说只要不搞到你头上，你就当没看见，搞到你头上你才要出手争取你自己的利益？上次搞你你不高兴，但是这次搞别人你就没所谓了？", "char_start": 395, "char_end": 456}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "如果是这样，你也别惊讶为啥别人对你的利益被侵犯无动于衷了——但好歹无动于衷并不表示对你争取自己的利益反感。", "char_start": 457, "char_end": 510}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "会反感，只会是因为你争取利益的方式本身损害了ta们的利益——比如不给发奖金就把公司的门堵上、“今天不给我一个交代谁也别想好过”这一类。", "char_start": 511, "char_end": 578}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "如果你能找到外科手术式的手段，如同靶向药一样精准的打击对手的痛点而完美的避开无辜，那么大家何止对你维护权利没有意见，还会对你的精心照顾心有感激，对你的手段心生敬佩。", "char_start": 579, "char_end": 661}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "你只是需要多投入一些智力资源，考虑好怎么能达成目的而又不产生附带伤害就可以了。", "char_start": 662, "char_end": 701}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "只不过既然你会为这个级别的问题困扰，说明你掌握斗争尺度的能力可能比较欠缺，建议你想到了策略也和更有经验和斗争智慧的长辈商量一下。", "char_start": 702, "char_end": 766}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "平时多看历史书，对培养这种直觉有好处。", "char_start": 767, "char_end": 786}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"quote": 1, "paragraph": 18}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0574"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：当我的利益被侵犯或受损的时候，我却羞于为自己争取利益。怕大家不会喜欢我。我该怎么办？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017"], "summary": "围绕“靶向药”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“当我的利益被侵犯或受损的时候，我却羞于为自己争取利益。也不知道为什么，总是没有勇气说出自己的要求，担心大家因为“我为自己争取利益”而不喜欢我。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "quote", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "当我的利益被侵犯或受损的时候，我却羞于为自己争取利益。也不知道为什么，总是没有勇气说出自己的要求，担心大家因为“我为自己争取利益”而不喜欢我。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 71, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "6f4bef26-7da0-52f4-ba36-4b31bc224b4d", "source_ordinal": 21, "reading_ordinal": 4035, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "喧宾夺主", "published_at": "2026-07-11T19:00:00+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/2039366484430943814/answer/2039632194893828673"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "礼仪有两个层面的价值——内在的精神意义和外在的政治意义。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 28}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "内在的精神意义是它的本意，是为了改变直接参与者的信念与认知。", "char_start": 29, "char_end": 59}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "外在的政治意义，是通过展示自己的影响力，改变参与者、举办者和观看者之间的关系——也就是俗称的“排场”。", "char_start": 60, "char_end": 111}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "比如阅兵，内在的含义是改善部队和检阅主体之间的关系，外在的含义则是向观礼者们展现国威军威。落足落在观看者身上。", "char_start": 112, "char_end": 167}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "参与者和观看者对待礼仪的态度是不一样的。参与者直接站在队列里，是礼仪的一部分，是歃血为盟里要参与割手指、喝黄酒的人。而观礼者仅仅是见证人，是不参与礼仪的，也和礼仪本身的成功与否没有利害攸关。", "char_start": 168, "char_end": 263}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "就婚礼而言，新人和密友（伴郎伴娘）、近亲师长（父母及其兄弟姐妹、祖辈、师父师娘）属于参与者，这是主人团的一部分，而其他外围远亲、邻居、同事……仅仅是观礼，这是纯客人。", "char_start": 264, "char_end": 347}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "问题来了——很多人办婚礼的时候只想着收取红包差额盈利、搞出排场来“展示实力”，没有控制参与者和观看者的比重，弄得观看者人数过多。", "char_start": 348, "char_end": 412}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "观看者人数比例过大，就会导致婚礼安排从以新人感受、婚礼自身的精神价值为核心，转向了以观礼者的感受和耐心为核心。", "char_start": 413, "char_end": 468}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "变成了新人和家属以庞大然而几乎不相关的红包人群们饿不饿、急不急、无聊不无聊为中心提供餐饮、休闲、娱乐服务。", "char_start": 469, "char_end": 522}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "仿佛是在收门票办一场节目，要赚这个票房了。", "char_start": 523, "char_end": 544}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "不这么做，这些纯来凑热闹的宾客们必然会觉得无聊和不适，进而以ta们庞大的人数不可避免的扭曲婚礼现场的气氛。", "char_start": 545, "char_end": 598}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "如果你希望婚礼仍然是以新人家族的精神意义为中心，那么你就要注意——邀请到场的外围观礼者的人数，最好不要超过直接参与礼仪的人数的两倍，要严格的保持在1.5-2倍之间。", "char_start": 599, "char_end": 681}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "这是保持礼仪基本性质的关键，否则你就会从“办婚礼”不可避免的转向“办晚会”。你整个考虑的核心都会从以新人为中心转向以来宾为中心。", "char_start": 682, "char_end": 746}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "新人会被降格为两个演员和服务员，不但不是礼仪的服务对象，礼仪的中心，反而成了礼仪的服务员、礼仪的边缘人物。", "char_start": 747, "char_end": 800}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "如果新人有这个明确的自觉意识、知道这是自己的主动选择倒也罢了，问题是二十几岁没有受过服务专业洗礼的新人，很可能根本没意识到这种“婚礼”其实是ta们要去服务客人，是现场最小的，而是天真的以为自己是婚礼的中心，是现场最大的。", "char_start": 801, "char_end": 911}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "而一旦自己的美好自我预期遭遇了几乎截然相反的事实逻辑，原本应该最美好的人生回忆反而可能变成创伤记忆。", "char_start": 912, "char_end": 962}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "如果你想要婚礼的精神价值，不想在自己的婚礼上当演员、当服务员，那么就非常不建议大量邀请外围观礼者——也就是新人自身不直接熟识的人。", "char_start": 963, "char_end": 1028}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "这些人的主要来源其实是双方父母的亲戚朋友，可能跟双方父母关系较近，有所来往，但对新人可能一大半都根本不认识。", "char_start": 1029, "char_end": 1083}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "这方面，就需要新人和父母们做好协商了。", "char_start": 1084, "char_end": 1103}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "这里有一个技巧——有意以“新人执意要如此”为由，把婚礼场地安排在某个稍微远一些的周边地点，做一场只有近亲密友参加的庄严肃穆的真正有纪念意义的小婚礼。然后就可以以“恐怕过度麻烦各位”为由，只在本地办一场不含礼仪的简短招待酒席，纾解一下父母“老熟人，儿女结婚却不通知我”的困境。", "char_start": 1104, "char_end": 1241}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "直接把这两个课题分离，把新人的交给新人，让ta们作为实至名归的主角，安心的享受属于自己的纪念，然后在另一场招待酒席上老老实实的担任服务员，轻松的帮助父母应付ta们的社交责任。", "char_start": 1242, "char_end": 1329}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "不要图省事硬合在一起办，硬合在一起，实际落地的其实是父母的招待宴，反而婚礼被牺牲了。", "char_start": 1330, "char_end": 1372}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "这对新人是非常不公且遗憾的。", "char_start": 1373, "char_end": 1387}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 23}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0574"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：如何评价新闻「婚礼仪式还没结束宾客已提前散场致新娘崩溃，酒店称新娘换装46分钟，客人也留不住」？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023"], "summary": "围绕“喧宾夺主”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“礼仪有两个层面的价值——内在的精神意义和外在的政治意义。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "礼仪有两个层面的价值——内在的精神意义和外在的政治意义。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 28, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
